1 0 0 1 54 738 Tm (11. Bounded Queue and Backpressure) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 723 Tm (BoundedAudioQueue implements a deliberate real-time policy: when the queue is full, drop the) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 708 Tm (oldest chunk instead of blocking the producer.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 693 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 678 Tm (if len\(self._items\) == self._capacity:) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 663 Tm (    self._items.popleft\(\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 648 Tm (    dropped = True) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 633 Tm (self._items.append\(item\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 618 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 54 603 Tm (That decision reflects the architecture document: stale live audio is usually less valuable) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 588 Tm (than current live audio. This is why the queue is bounded at all. If it were unbounded,) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 573 Tm (latency could grow silently.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 558 Tm () Tj
